# S-173 / TST-9, live: the core keyboard pressed with real key events on a real build
# (tooling/drive <profile> 50-tst9-keys.steps), on a profile 10-setup.steps built for
# this run alone: Home holds A, Folder[B], C, D; Work E; Play F. No pointer is used.
# The chords are docs/SHORTCUTS.md's. Shift-Cmd-[ and ] are in 51-tst9-brackets.steps,
# which needs the bracket keys in tooling/drive-window.py (tooling-drive-brackets.diff).
activate
wait 3
key 1+cmd
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-00-start.png
# Cmd held: the row numbers and the chips' Ctrl-numbers.
keydown cmd
wait 0.8
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-01a-numbers.png
keyup cmd
wait 0.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-01b-numbers-gone.png
# Cmd-2, Cmd-9, Cmd-1.
key 2+cmd
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-02a-cmd2.png
key 9+cmd
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-02b-cmd9.png
key 1+cmd
wait 1
# Option-Cmd-Down and Up: the next row down the sidebar, and back.
key down+cmd+alt
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-03a-next-row.png
key up+cmd+alt
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-03b-previous-row.png
# Ctrl-Tab, a tap: the tab used before. Cmd-3 then Cmd-1 makes C the one before A.
key 3+cmd
wait 1
key 1+cmd
wait 1
key tab+ctrl
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-04-ctrl-tab-tap.png
# Ctrl-Tab held: the strip of recent tabs, Tab steps it, letting go of Ctrl commits.
keydown ctrl
key tab+ctrl
wait 0.6
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-05a-strip.png
key tab+ctrl
wait 0.4
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-05b-strip-stepped.png
keyup ctrl
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-05c-committed.png
# Ctrl-Tab held, then Escape: back where the run began.
keydown ctrl
key tab+ctrl
wait 0.6
key esc+ctrl
keyup ctrl
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-06-escape.png
# Shift-Cmd-E: the Space's folders collapse, and again open.
key 1+cmd
wait 1
key e+cmd+shift
wait 1.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-07a-folders-collapsed.png
key e+cmd+shift
wait 1.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-07b-folders-open.png
# Cmd-S: the sidebar to the rail, and back.
key s+cmd
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-08a-cmd-s-rail.png
key s+cmd
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-08b-cmd-s-open.png
# Shift-Cmd-D: the address row hides, and shows again.
key d+cmd+shift
wait 1.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-09a-address-row-hidden.png
key d+cmd+shift
wait 1.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-09b-address-row-back.png
# Ctrl-2, Option-Cmd-Right and Left, Ctrl-1: Spaces by key.
key 2+ctrl
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-10a-ctrl2.png
key right+cmd+alt
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-10b-next-space.png
key left+cmd+alt
wait 2
key left+cmd+alt
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-10c-previous-twice.png
# Cmd-D on Page C: it becomes a pin of Home, above the Clear line.
key 3+cmd
wait 1
key d+cmd
wait 1.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-11a-cmd-d-pinned.png
# Cmd-W on that pin: it goes to sleep, its row stays, another row is on screen.
key w+cmd
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-11b-cmd-w-slept.png
# From here the numbers count the pin: Page C 1, Page A 2, Page B 3, Page D 4.
# Option-Shift-Cmd-Down on Page A: it moves below the folder (a folder beside it is one row).
key 2+cmd
wait 1
key down+cmd+alt+shift
wait 1.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-12-row-moved.png
# Option-Shift-Cmd-Right on Page A, now third: the tab moves to Work and the window follows.
key 3+cmd
wait 1
key right+cmd+alt+shift
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-13-tab-to-work.png
key 1+ctrl
wait 2
# Home is Page C (the pin), Page B, Page D. Shift-Cmd-C on Page D: the link is copied; the
# toast says so.
key 3+cmd
wait 1
key c+cmd+shift
wait 0.8
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-14-copy-link-toast.png
wait 3
# Ctrl-Cmd-N: a split of Page D with a new one; its two panes take the numbers 3 and 4.
key n+cmd+ctrl
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-15-split.png
key esc
wait 1
# Cmd-W on a plain row, Page B (2), then Shift-Cmd-T: it comes back in place.
key 2+cmd
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-16a-before-close.png
key w+cmd
wait 1.5
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-16b-closed-toast.png
key t+cmd+shift
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-16c-reopened.png
# Shift-Cmd-P, then Escape: actions mode opens and closes.
key p+cmd+shift
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-17a-actions.png
key esc
wait 1
# Ctrl-M: the tab mutes; the bar's row says Unmute Tab afterwards.
key m+ctrl
wait 1
key p+cmd+shift
wait 1
type mute
wait 1
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-18-mute-row.png
# The first Escape leaves actions mode for the bar's search, the second closes the bar.
key esc
wait 0.5
key esc
wait 1
key m+ctrl
wait 1
# Shift-Cmd-K, last: Clear closes the Space's unpinned tabs and leaves the pin.
key k+cmd+shift
wait 2
shot @SHOTS@/tst9-19-clear.png
